1. Find the project named "Harbor Launch"
2. Find the document within that project named "Launch readiness checklist" that was last edited by Priya Nair
3. Set its content to "Launch approved — final sign-off recorded."

Let me first query the project. Linear's GraphQL API:

```graphql
query {
  projects(state: active) {
    nodes {
      id
      name
      description
    }
  }
}
```

Then documents: Linear added documents to the API. The `documents` query:

```graphql
query {
  documents(filter: { ... }) {
    nodes {
      id
      title
      content
      lastEditedAt
      lastEditor { name }
    }
  }
}
```

